#: 8cfe1027fbdf4a2a9550c9696dab5301
msgid "Now we can create the BallJointConstraint:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../dart/user_guide/tutorials/multi-pendulum.md:377
#: 5078410957294535ad8582b497736abe
msgid "And then add it to the world:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../dart/user_guide/tutorials/multi-pendulum.md:383
#: 9e7253c65f604212a123524fe51c1260
msgid ""
"Now we also want to be able to remove this constraint. In the function "
"``removeConstraint()``, we can put the following code:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../dart/user_guide/tutorials/multi-pendulum.md:391
#: 9947c92801ae4ea18009b7630d44c7a8
msgid ""
"Setting mBallConstraint to a nullptr will allow its smart pointer to "
"delete it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../dart/user_guide/tutorials/multi-pendulum.md:393
#: 9841cf0c9698403bb273edec30113d3a
msgid "**Now you are ready to run the demo!**"
msgstr ""
